    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 375 of the laws of 1999, amending the real property\nactions and proceedings law relating to new owners of buildings for which\nadministrators have been appointed pursuant to article 7-A of such law, in\nrelation to the effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S9411",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9411-2023",
